          <tr><td>Institutions and museums</td><td>Named cultural institutions</td><td>the British Museum, the Louvre, the Tate, the National Gallery</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Fixed exceptions</td><td>Learn as chunks</td><td>the High Street, the Strand, the Mall, the Hague, the West End</td></tr>
        </tbody>
